Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:01:51.70,B,,0,0,0,,DRAFT revision r3 - no lip-sync, placeholder sound, not final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.77,0:00:06.97,C,,0,0,0,,Potter, don't turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.15,0:00:08.07,C,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.13,0:00:09.61,C,,0,0,0,,Only at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.69,0:00:11.37,C,,0,0,0,,And walk over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.51,0:00:12.43,C,,0,0,0,,Slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.67,0:00:16.57,C,,0,0,0,,Dance with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.85,0:00:18.97,C,,0,0,0,,The floor won't touch us while we're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.33,0:00:20.14,C,,0,0,0,,You may scream
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.11,0:00:21.95,C,,0,0,0,,at me the moment we're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:23.41,C,,0,0,0,,Fine - I'm dancing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.59,0:00:24.46,C,,0,0,0,,Now tell me what those things
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.43,0:00:26.35,C,,0,0,0,,are and why they want me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.67,0:00:29.04,C,,0,0,0,,It's a long story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:31.53,C,,0,0,0,,and it ends with you breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.11,0:00:33.97,C,,0,0,0,,Eyes on the ceiling, Potter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.09,0:00:35.30,C,,0,0,0,,Not on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.27,0:00:37.75,C,,0,0,0,,The arrows land on the orchestra's offbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.26,C,,0,0,0,,Change your step with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.23,0:00:40.14,C,,0,0,0,,half a beat late,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.11,0:00:40.97,C,,0,0,0,,on my count.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.05,0:00:45.63,C,,0,0,0,,You counted, clever boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.17,0:00:47.49,C,,0,0,0,,Then count faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.65,0:00:49.77,C,,0,0,0,,The music won't slow down for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.29,0:00:51.55,C,,0,0,0,,Show off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:54.11,C,,0,0,0,,Even you can't cut all three.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:00:58.93,C,,0,0,0,,Efficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:01:00.32,C,,0,0,0,,Remind me to applaud once
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.35,C,,0,0,0,,the orchestra gives me my hand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.95,0:01:04.99,C,,0,0,0,,I meant to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.21,0:01:07.39,C,,0,0,0,,The trolley was always part of the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.07,0:01:09.32,C,,0,0,0,,No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.29,0:01:10.59,C,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the catch anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.93,0:01:13.01,C,,0,0,0,,He's using the waltz grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.41,0:01:15.20,C,,0,0,0,,Every proper step we dance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.17,0:01:17.29,C,,0,0,0,,together seals another door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.85,0:01:20.03,C,,0,0,0,,Then we dance it wrong on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.41,0:01:22.33,C,,0,0,0,,Break the grid with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.85,0:01:24.45,C,,0,0,0,,That was your plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.69,0:01:26.89,C,,0,0,0,,Drop the ceiling on the whole hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.77,0:01:29.73,C,,0,0,0,,Left side, three beats,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.75,0:01:30.75,C,,0,0,0,,the red table.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.95,0:01:31.74,C,,0,0,0,,Flip it on my mark
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:33.15,C,,0,0,0,,and hold it over us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:36.43,C,,0,0,0,,Harry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.35,0:01:39.13,C,,0,0,0,,It has our names.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.37,C,,0,0,0,,Both of them burned right in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.67,0:01:43.84,C,,0,0,0,,Draconia, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:44.77,C,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:48.43,C,,0,0,0,,I spent weeks trying to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.45,0:01:50.53,C,,0,0,0,,You never once listened.
